          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 47.643,
          "en": "for adding a background that has some transparency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.68,
          "end": 53.34,
          "en": "Now, in addition, on the dialog itself, not the backdrop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.34,
          "end": 56.58,
          "en": "I'll add some padding in all directions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 56.58,
          "end": 58.35,
          "en": "give it rounded corners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.35,
          "end": 60.993,
          "en": "and add a shadow behind it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 65.943,
          "en": "With that, if we save that, this looks much better already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.14,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "But of course, the content in there doesn't look great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "and here, to make sure that it does look better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 76.32,
          "en": "I'll go to the NoProjectSelected component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.32,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "and simply copy the classes I added to the h2 tag here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "And therefore, we could also put this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 86.01,
          "en": "into a separate reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.01,
          "end": 88.2,
          "en": "but here, to save some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.2,
          "end": 91.113,
          "en": "I'll just copy and paste these styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.75999999999999,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "So in the NewProject component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 96.93299999999999,
          "en": "I'll add this class name to the h2 tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.4,
          "end": 102.813,
          "en": "and then grab this className here from the paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 108.93299999999999,
          "en": "and add that here to my paragraphs I have in that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
