        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "to avoid copy and pasting this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 118.35,
          "en": "but since I'm only using these classes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.35,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "on a few elements and I wanna save some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 122.853,
          "en": "I will just copy and paste them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.96,
          "end": 125.34,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.34,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "this definitely looks a bit better, I'd say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "Now, the button doesn't look great though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "but here, I'll fix this by going to the Modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "and there, on this form, I'll add a class name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 143.1,
          "en": "which adds some margin to the top and then moves this button",
