        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.1,
          "end": 146.04,
          "en": "to the right by setting the text alignment to right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 147.963,
          "en": "with this text-right clause.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.01,
          "end": 152.04,
          "en": "And in addition, instead of using the standard button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.04,
          "end": 153.753,
          "en": "I'll use my own button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 156.66,
          "en": "which I'll import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.66,
          "end": 159.363,
          "en": "from Button.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.61,
          "end": 164.05,
          "en": "Of course, also for the closing tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.02,
          "end": 168.03300000000002,
          "en": "so that this button looks nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 171.57,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 175.17000000000002,
          "en": "I think the text should be a little bit darker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 178.62,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll actually tweak those styles here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 182.88,
          "en": "and choose darker text colors for the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.88,
          "end": 184.893,
          "en": "and also for the paragraphs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.86,
          "end": 190.353,
          "en": "With that, that looks quite decent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.94,
          "end": 193.41,
          "en": "So now, we got this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 197.28300000000002,
          "en": "which will appear if we have at least one invalid input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.15,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "So even if I enter values here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 203.34,
          "en": "if I don't enter a date, I'll get this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.34,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "But as soon as I also do pick a date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "and I therefore have valid values in all inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 211.563,
          "en": "I can save this and the project is added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "So therefore, now as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 217.14,
          "en": "let's make sure that this Cancel button also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.14,
          "end": 218.4,
          "en": "And for that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.4,
          "end": 223.07999999999998,
          "en": "we have to make sure that in the NewProject component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.07999999999998,
          "end": 225,
          "en": "this Cancel button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 227.823,
          "en": "in the end changes the state in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.14,
          "end": 231.75,
          "en": "because there, we just need to switch back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 231.75,
          "end": 234,
          "en": "to this undefined state to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 236.673,
          "en": "this NoProjectSelected component again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.5,
          "end": 240.87,
          "en": "Therefore, here in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.87,
          "end": 242.973,
          "en": "we can add another new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.103,
          "end": 248.553,
          "en": "handleCancelAddProject could be the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 251.79,
          "en": "Since that's what we're doing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.79,
          "end": 254.793,
          "en": "we're canceling the creation of a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.93,
          "end": 257.49,
          "en": "And in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.49,
          "end": 260.34,
          "en": "I'll copy that code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 260.34,
          "end": 261.69,
          "en": "from handleStartAddProject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.74,
          "end": 267.153,
          "en": "but I'll set the selectedProjectID to undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 268.53,
          "end": 271.74,
          "en": "and now, it's a pointer at this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 271.74,
          "end": 274.23,
          "en": "that should be passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.23,
          "end": 277.443,
          "en": "to my NewProject component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 278.64,
          "end": 281.73,
          "en": "So that here we have a onCancel prop baby",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 281.73,
          "end": 286.35,
          "en": "to which we pass the handleCancelAddProject function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.35,
          "end": 287.523,
          "en": "we just worked on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 290.94,
          "en": "Inside of NewProject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 290.94,
          "end": 295.14,
          "en": "we now must accept this newly added onCancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.14,
          "end": 297.933,
          "en": "So here, we should add it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 303.633,
          "en": "and then make sure that we connect it to this Cancel button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 306.18,
          "en": "So here on this Cancel button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 306.18,
          "end": 310.11,
          "en": "we can simply add onClick and pass onCancel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.11,
          "end": 312.09,
          "en": "as a value to onClick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 312.09,
          "end": 317.09,
          "en": "so that if this button is clicked, onCancel is triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 317.31,
          "end": 318.81,
          "en": "and onCancel, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 318.81,
          "end": 322.68,
          "en": "simply is this Cancel, CancelAddProject function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.68,
          "end": 327.003,
          "en": "which will reset our selectedProjectID to undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 327.9,
          "end": 329.1,
          "en": "And therefore, with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 329.1,
          "end": 333.09000000000003,
          "en": "if we do click cancel, we're back on this starting screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 333.09000000000003,
          "end": 333.923,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 335.28,
          "end": 336.63,
          "en": "So that all works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 336.63,
          "end": 339.96,
          "en": "And the next step there for now is to finally make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.96,
          "end": 341.85,
          "en": "that we can select those projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 341.85,
          "end": 344.253,
          "en": "and view some project details here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
